{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43631","headline":"秋日卢郎中使君幼平泛舟联句一首 · 清昼","name":"秋日卢郎中使君幼平泛舟联句一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共载清秋客船，同瞻皂盖朝天。\n悔使比来相得，如今欲别潸然。\n渐惊徒驭分散，愁望云山接连。\n魏阙驰心日日，吴城挥手年年。\n送远已伤飞雁，裁诗更切嘶蝉。\n空怀鄠杜心醉，永望门栏脰捐。\n别思无穷无限，还如秋水秋烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43631.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43631","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}